participant "Managed Agents API" as API
Client -> API : Create Session with Agent and Environment references
API -> API : Validate effective configuration and initial events
alt Empty initial events
  API --> Client : Idle Session
  Client -> API : Submit task later
  API --> Client : Accepted event
else Initial work supplied
  API --> Client : Running Session
end
Client -> API : Open event stream
API -->> Client : Agent output and Session status
