title Execute One Managed Tool - Recorded Beta Contract
participant "Client application" as Client
participant "Managed Agents API" as API
participant "Managed tool environment" as Managed
alt Server-executed built-in or MCP tool
  API -->> Client : Tool request; request permission when policy requires
  Client -> API : Confirmation when required
  API -> Managed : Execute only if allowed
  Managed --> API : Tool result
else Application-executed custom tool
  API -->> Client : Custom tool request; requires action
  Client -> Client : Execute application code
  Client -> API : Custom tool result
end
API -->> Client : Continued message and Session status
note over API,Managed
  Managed means Session sandbox or remote MCP server.
  They are alternative executors, not sequential stages.
  Custom tools are outside permission_policy.
end note
