title Restore a Managed Session View - Recorded Beta Contract
participant User
participant "Client view" as Client
participant "Managed Agents APIs" as API
User -> Client : Open Session
Client -> API : Read Session and complete history pages
API --> Client : Resource, status and persisted events
Client -> Client : Build visible timelines
Client -> API : Open live stream
API -->> Client : Temporary preview deltas
API --> Client : Complete message
Client -> Client : Replace matching preview with complete event
... Observation disconnects ...
Client -> API : Reopen stream and query history again
API --> Client : Complete events missed offline
Client -> Client : Deduplicate and reconcile
note over Client,API
  Preview is best-effort; it is not persisted or replayed.
  Child Thread history and preview remain scoped to that Thread.
end note
